<control id="u11c667aa-1006" class="AppControlSidecar" script="u11c667aa-1006"><graphic language=""><text text=" Overview The Cisco Wireless Service Module 2 (WiSM2) Controller for Catalyst 6500 Series Switches is a highly scalable and flexible platform, enabling services-rich wireless functions in medium-sized to large enterprises and campus environments. Designed for 802.11n performance and maximum scalability, the WiSM2 controller supports a higher density of clients and delivers more efficient roaming, simultaneously managing up to 500 access points and 10,000 clients. The Wireless Services Module in the Catalyst 6500 chassis provides the highest performance, security, and scalability to support mission-critical wireless business communications. The integrated wireless blade in the Catalyst chassis offers users a cost-effective wireless controller option, increasing the ROI of their Catalyst investment while reducing hardware costs. The WiSM2 for Catalyst 6500 Series Switches supports: Roaming across wider geographic areas and faster performance for simultaneous applications VideoStream technology for optimized video performance CleanAir technology for a self-healing, self-optimizing network that avoids RF interference Layer 3 mobility services for video, voice, guest, location, Enterprise Wireless Mesh, and teleworking Highest level of wireless security, with Layer 1 Wireless intrusion prevention system (wIPS) capabilities " html="html"><![CDATA[<span class='Bold'>Overview</span><br><span class='Bullet2'>The Cisco Wireless Service Module 2 (WiSM2) Controller for Catalyst 6500 Series Switches is a highly scalable and flexible platform, enabling services-rich wireless functions in medium-sized to large enterprises and campus environments.</span><br><span class='Bullet2'>Designed for 802.11n performance and maximum scalability, the WiSM2 controller supports a higher density of clients and delivers more efficient roaming, simultaneously managing up to 500 access points and 10,000 clients. </span><br><span class='Bullet2'>The Wireless Services Module in the Catalyst 6500 chassis provides the highest performance, security, and scalability to support mission-critical wireless business communications. </span><br><span class='Bullet2'>The integrated wireless blade in the Catalyst chassis offers users a cost-effective wireless controller option, increasing the ROI of their Catalyst investment while reducing hardware costs.</span><br><br>The WiSM2 for Catalyst 6500 Series Switches supports:<br><span class='Bullet2'>Roaming across wider geographic areas and faster performance for simultaneous applications</span><br><span class='Bullet2'>VideoStream technology for optimized video performance</span><br><span class='Bullet2'>CleanAir technology for a self-healing, self-optimizing network that avoids RF interference</span><br><span class='Bullet2'>Layer 3 mobility services for video, voice, guest, location, Enterprise Wireless Mesh, and teleworking</span><br><span class='Bullet2'>Highest level of wireless security, with Layer 1 Wireless intrusion prevention system (wIPS) capabilities</span><br>]]></text><field name="titleText" value="Next Generation Wireless Service Module"/><field name="tipText" value="Remove"/></graphic>
